Superweapon sounds, animations and radar events audit+fix.

Per-type audit across all 12 superweapons against evamd/rulesmd/artmd:
charge anims follow each building's OWN superweapon instead of the house's
first record; missing EVA lines (Dominator/Mutator Detected+Ready+Activated,
ForceShield/PsychicReveal Ready); missing sounds (NukeLaunch+DigSound,
IronCurtainBlast, ChronosphereMove, WeatherIntro, Dominator/Mutator/Reveal
activates, ForceShieldStarting); missing anims (PDFXCLD/PDFXLOC, FORCSHLD);
radar event 13 on offensive fires and impacts. No save-format change.
Tests in test_superweapon.cpp (Type= mapping, dominator events).

